        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bernard Sumner, Johnny Marr, Paul Savage\n- Bands: Electronic, The Delgados, New Order, The Smiths\n- Songs: \"Disappointed\"\n- Places: England, Scotland, Motherwell, North Lanarkshire\n- Genres: alternative dance, indie rock\n- Roles: singer, guitarist, drummer, musician, record producer\n\nFacts:\n- Electronic were an English alternative dance supergroup formed by New Order singer and guitarist Bernard Sumner and former Smiths guitarist Johnny Marr.\n- \"Disappointed\" was the fourth single by the English band Electronic.\n- The Delgados were a Scottish indie rock band from Motherwell, North Lanarkshire.\n- Paul Savage is a Scottish musician and record producer best known as the drummer in the Scottish indie rock band The Delgados.",
